WEBVTT

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:20.330
Wow, look at that!

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:22.500
Sure is dark.

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:55.000
Brushing things off with a "whatever"

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.130
Stuck later in an unchanging life

00:00:58.210 --> 00:01:00.380
The whatevers became habit

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:03.670
My skills still have yet to bloom

00:01:03.670 --> 00:01:08.630
If I don't try to win and but am unwilling to lose

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:14.290
Why does this cold heart still beat with time?

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:20.580
All of us are monsters with hidden powers

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:26.170
Are we going to live without awakening them?

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:29.460
We push things down and cover them up

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:32.330
And our hearts are fresh no more

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:37.080
But we're monsters who continue on without so much as a face

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:43.500
All of us have undiscovered powers hidden inside

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:47.380
You're up next

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:53.080
Stand and face it monster

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:08.790
We may make progress down this way.

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:10.290
Let's check it out!

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:14.670
Yuji, everything okay?

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:17.130
No trouble or nothin'?

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:19.710
Dryad, you head back into the woods.

00:02:20.130 --> 00:02:22.080
No telling what we'll find in here.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:25.040
A-all right... Just be careful.

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:28.960
Yuji!

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:30.880
You gotta check this out!

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:36.420
What is this...?

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:42.500
This place is huge!

00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:44.540
And so is this thing!

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:47.880
It's some sort of machine.

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:51.330
Since when does this world have tech like this?

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:54.630
Yuji!

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:58.210
There's more over here!

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:03.750
Wonder what it is.

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:06.000
That's another one of those things.

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:09.000
Is this where they're making magic stones?

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:14.960
What's going on?!

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:17.380
Is the magic infuser still working?

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:21.040
Those capes...

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:24.750
This stone's no good.

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:26.750
We better report this to Javier!

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:35.580
Javier? Is he who's making these things?

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:44.080
Better be more careful from here on.

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:46.380
Yahoo!

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:49.540
Wonder what we'll find next?

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:51.330
Bet it'll be fun!

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.790
We'll be off, then!

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:59.330
Monster Stealth.

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:04.710
Might as well leave it to them, I guess.

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:12.710
Sense Share

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:14.630
Sure are lots of diverging paths.

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:16.080
Yuji!

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:19.500
We found 'em!

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.540
And we shan't let them escape!

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:27.710
You can get in, right?

00:04:27.710 --> 00:04:29.170
Leave it to us!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.170
We're built for this!

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:45.540
Huh?

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:48.540
Looks like a dead end.

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:50.750
Not even room to squeeze through.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:53.170
Where'd those two go?

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:56.420
Hey, over here!

00:04:57.250 --> 00:04:59.330
And yet another here.

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:02.880
Explains why they came as a pair.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:06.130
Slimes, pull both those levers at the same time.

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:07.830
You got it!

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:09.670
Ready? Jump!

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:14.460
Wow! Nice thinking, Yuji!

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:15.460
Yay!

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:16.290
Here we come!

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:17.210
And verily!

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:24.000
Those slimes sure are making ground.

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:26.830
Yeah, the place seems pretty large.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:30.580
Yuji, we hit another dead end.

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:33.130
But there's something here!

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:35.420
Looks like it leads above ground.

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:36.710
Can you climb it?

00:05:36.710 --> 00:05:38.210
No problem!

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:41.000
Hop, step, jump!

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:43.500
Sense Share

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:51.630
That's...

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:00.040
Hey, I know this place!

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:04.920
It's the smiley people village.

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:08.750
Yup. That's Messias.

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:20.080
Master Javier, we have news of great importance.

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:21.460
Those capes...

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:29.080
Are they all followers of The Blue Moon of Salvation?

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:34.130
Seems like they secretly moved in on this abandoned
village and started using it to forge magic stones.

00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:41.790
You're telling me that explosion
destroyed our Curse Well?

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:45.920
It would appear so.
The magic infuser was damaged, too.

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:49.170
Many of the stones are still incomplete...

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:51.670
How could this happen?!

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:55.880
Was that big machine their "Curse Well"?

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:58.790
Gather anyone who doesn't have work to do!

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:01.880
I'm putting together a search party
for more cursed magic ores!

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:13.420
Moments ago our Curse Well was destroyed.

00:07:13.710 --> 00:07:17.330
But the scale of the explosion
was nothing any human is capable of.

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:19.580
We're surely dealing with a meteorite impact or the like.

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:24.500
But now we must retrieve the cursed magic ores
from the forest at all cost!

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:28.540
Even if we can't get all 108,
get as many as you can, as fast as you can!

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:32.630
These must be the ores
they turn into cursed magic stones.

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:35.500
Sure glad they use such
easy to follow naming conventions.

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:38.830
But won't people take notice if we all move out at once?

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:41.460
What will we do if we're spotted?

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:44.080
Kill any witnesses.

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:47.210
No need to worry about
making the deaths look unsuspicious.

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:52.040
With the Curse Well destroyed
we have no need for this village any more.

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:53.330
Now go!

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:54.290
Yessir!

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:00.330
Sounds to me like they're getting out of hand.

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:03.290
Which means there's only one thing to do
before things get worse.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:07.960
All slimes in the forest, I want you to encircle the village.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.670
But we don't want to be so close that they notice.

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:13.420
Make your circle one kilo outside its perimeter.

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:16.000
You got it!

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:18.130
We're basically done already.

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:21.880
That's them slimes for ya, always quick to it!

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:24.460
Okay, next...

00:08:25.710 --> 00:08:29.330
Find out if there's anyone else in the village
besides the Blue Moon followers.

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:31.880
You got it!

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:33.540
We can handle that!

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:37.880
Lookin' for people, lookin' for people...

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:46.330
Master Javier, what is our next move?

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:50.210
We abandon this village the moment
we have our cursed magic stones.

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:54.670
It would appear these lot are all who take shelter here.

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:53.210
We'll make a stop back at headquarters,

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:55.830
then move off to a new location where we can continue production...

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:55.830
Now's our chance, then.

00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:58.040
Let's explore the area.

00:08:58.580 --> 00:08:59.460
Slimes!

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:00.960
You got it!

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:06.210
Wow, look how bright it is in here!

00:09:06.210 --> 00:09:09.290
Slimes, quietly pack up all books and documents for me.

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:11.630
Take the entire bookshelf if you want.

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:13.170
Sure thing!

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:15.130
Found a few documents.

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:17.170
And a letter, too!

00:09:21.170 --> 00:09:23.460
Yuji, here they come!

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:24.710
Faster than I thought.

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:27.460
Spell Transfer - Magical Net!

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:37.750
"Cleanse this tainted world!"

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:46.880
Sense Share

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:46.880
Sense Share

00:09:43.130 --> 00:09:44.580
These guys too, huh?

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:46.830
What now?

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:54.130
Sense Share

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:54.130
Sense Share

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:54.130
Sense Share

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:50.670
If we let them escape they're bound
to drag innocent people into this.

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:52.460
We continue with the plan.

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:53.670
Okay!

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:57.710
Yuji! There's another sealed door!

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:55.380
Sense Share

00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:00.960
I can't fit!

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:03.040
It's closed real tight!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.580
That's some security...

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:06.040
But wait...

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:10.290
Slimes, do you see any levers nearby this one?

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:13.040
Nothing of the sort.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:15.040
This room sure is bright, though.

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:16.540
So shiny!

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:20.670
There were five of them, so maybe...

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:23.880
Slimes, I want each of you
to stand before one of the lamps.

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:25.710
You got it!

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:32.920
Spell Transfer - Wind Slicer!

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:48.250
That did the trick!

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:49.960
Are you seeing this?!

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:56.710
Look how shiny THIS is!

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:58.170
We've got real jewels!

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:00.630
And skellies!

00:11:00.710 --> 00:11:07.210
Sense Share

00:11:00.710 --> 00:11:07.210
Support Magic

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:05.000
Can't imagine that's someone
who wanted to die in there...

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:06.710
Yuji!

00:11:07.420 --> 00:11:09.710
One of their numbers is headed that way!

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:14.210
This can't be!

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:25.960
What do you mean we've lost
all our texts and treasures?!

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:28.210
Do we have a thief on our hands?

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:30.380
But how did they do it?

00:11:31.130 --> 00:11:32.540
They're starting to catch on.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.040
Now what?

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:37.040
Do I hit them with a Hellfire of Demise?

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:41.880
Master Javier, we're picking up
no trace of our scout team!

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:44.710
What?! Not a single one?

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:49.460
So it would seem... Not even the faintest trace.

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:54.210
This must mean that explosion
was in fact an attack after all.

00:11:54.670 --> 00:11:56.880
Likely by whoever stole from us, as well.

00:11:57.330 --> 00:12:03.420
If they're this powerful though,
why haven't they finished us off already?

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:07.080
There's only one explanation.

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:10.170
You think they've figured out how it works?

00:12:10.670 --> 00:12:11.750
How what works?

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:15.670
Indeed. The Cleansing Flame...

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:24.960
If all of us here meet our fate,
it is set to erupt, cleansing the world in its blaze.

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:29.580
Our enemy must be aware of its existence.

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:31.830
That's good to know.

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:35.000
Guess I'm glad I didn't burn the place down.

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:38.130
What's our next move?

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:41.880
We strike back!

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:47.250
None are present here but us five and our intruder.

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:51.580
Surely you need no further explanation.

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:06.580
"Cleanse this tainted world!"

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:32.880
Things are getting rumbly!

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:34.040
This is bad!

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:38.790
Slimes, time to make an emergency retreat!

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:39.880
Group up!

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:43.960
Yuji, what do we do now?

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:45.380
We escape!

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:48.750
Spell Transfer - Barrier Sphere!

00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:50.080
Defense Boost!

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:52.500
How's this gonna work?

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:57.420
This is gonna be rough, but bear with me.
Spell Transfer - Blast!

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:56.000
Spell Transfer - Blast

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:02.080
This is awesome!

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:04.000
We have taken to the skies!

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:05.130
All right, then.

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:09.750
Barrier List

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:09.750
Anti-Physical Barrier

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:09.460
Anti-Physical Barrier!

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:11.500
Barrier List

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:11.500
Anti-Magic Barrier

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:11.040
Anti-Magic Barrier!

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:13.500
Barrier List

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:13.500
Spell-Transferring Barrier

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:13.170
Spell-Transferring Barrier!

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:26.080
Can't be sure just how strong
this "Cleansing Flame" is going to be.

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:27.960
We're back!

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:29.420
All accounted for.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:51.290
This isn't going to hold. I need a stronger barrier...

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:55.790
Barrier List

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:57.250
Nothing?

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:59.170
Then I'll just have to make one!

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:06.750
Yuji, it's not gonna hold much longer!

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:09.460
Those black flames are gonna bust loose!

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:16.630
Black flames...

00:15:17.380 --> 00:15:18.210
That's it!

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:21.330
Anti-Physical Barrier

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:20.330
Dispels and ice!

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:21.330
Anti-Magic Barrier

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:21.330
Dispel Curse - Extreme

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:30.210
Total Isolation Array

00:15:30.210 --> 00:15:32.710
Holy Magic

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:31.790
Sounds strong to me.

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:34.710
Yuji!

00:15:35.130 --> 00:15:37.000
The end is nigh!

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:39.830
Total Isolation Array!

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.330
This is gonna be bad!

00:15:52.710 --> 00:15:54.540
My other barriers are done for.

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:57.580
This Total Isolation Array is all I've got...

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:01.500
Status Effect: Excessive Magic Use

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:03.630
Can I hold out long enough...?

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:20.920
Status Effect: Excessive Magic Use

00:16:37.170 --> 00:16:39.170
Status Effect: Excessive Magic Use

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:07.960
Status Effect: Excessive Magic Use

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:10.040
Never know until you try, I guess.

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:21.040
Cut that one a little close, eh?

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:22.630
Didn't realize you were there.

00:17:22.630 --> 00:17:24.170
'Course I was!

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:25.580
Hiding the whole time!

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:27.250
Not the WHOLE time!

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:29.380
You certainly weren't within sight.

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:31.250
You could definitely see me!

00:17:29.830 --> 00:17:31.250
You were scared, weren't you?

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:32.040
No, I was just-

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:32.580
Slacking off!

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:33.330
Just hear me out!

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:34.630
That means no dinner for you.

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:37.500
WHAT?! NO! YUJI!

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:44.460
Yuji!

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:46.790
Yuji's back!

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:49.330
You're all right!

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:50.750
Had us worried.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:53.420
You just up and vanished
when you went after those Greedy Boars.

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:55.540
Did I miss something?

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:59.500
You're telling me you didn't notice
that huge explosion out there?

00:17:59.670 --> 00:18:01.750
Not just one, but two!

00:18:01.960 --> 00:18:04.250
We thought maybe meteors were raining down on us.

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:09.130
Again with that. What's with people here and meteorites?

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:12.130
Good thing they didn't land here in town.

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:14.080
You're telling me.

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:18.040
But might be thanks to them
that the frost is finally starting to thaw.

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:38.000
Looks like the warm weather's here for good!

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:39.960
Hey, Yuji!

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:41.920
Good morning!

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:45.380
We're celebrating winter's end!

00:18:45.880 --> 00:18:47.420
Come join us!

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:54.750
The guest of honor's finally here!

00:18:57.830 --> 00:18:59.210
Guest of honor...?

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:03.170
That'd be you. You got our firewood reserves filled.

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:05.750
We're set even if this whole place freezes over again.

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:08.710
You're the star of our defrosting celebration!

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:13.790
This feels like a bit much...

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:16.710
But here's to a newly warm Ricaardo!

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:18.330
To Ricaardo!

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:25.880
Yuji, thank you for handling our Greedy Boar problem.

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:29.670
We stocked up on the very best
Rishia herbs this morning!

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:31.710
Which means...!

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:39.250
Yup! This here's the real-deal Angus cattle
and Rishia herb stew! A master-class special treat!

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:42.170
Let's go, go, go, go!

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:50.210
Th-this... is...

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:59.080
Yuji, are you all right?

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:01.830
Have you ever seen someone
cry themselves unconscious?

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:04.880
Ever seen a face as happy as that?

00:20:16.670 --> 00:20:18.380
That stew was GOOD.

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:23.670
Right then, better look through those texts from Messias.

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:29.000
Nighty-night...

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:42.080
Was a spell cast on these?

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:49.830
This is the only one that still has text.

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:52.000
It's a list of some sort...

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:57.580
Looks like these are names of people
The Blue Moon of Salvation was after.

00:21:34.170 --> 00:21:37.080
Adventurer

00:21:34.170 --> 00:21:37.080
Yuji

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:42.080
EPISODE 6

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:42.080
INFILTRATING AN OMINOUS VILLAGE

00:21:42.380 --> 00:21:44.710
Time to eat! Da da da dan!

00:21:44.960 --> 00:21:47.670
Exploration and procurement are our specialties

00:21:47.670 --> 00:21:49.130
"Be sure to bring lots of friends!"

00:21:50.130 --> 00:21:52.920
There's always an encounter one step away from town

00:21:52.920 --> 00:21:54.250
"Agh, I'm starved! My strength is gone!"

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:55.710
"Look at all these tough baddies!"

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:57.080
"This is ridic! Seriously ridic!"

00:21:57.080 --> 00:22:02.290
"Crazy, wild, and super glaring!"

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:59.380
"Well it seems time we use our secret weapon!"

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:01.000
"Since when do we have one?"

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:03.290
"I say we ruuun!"

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:06.500
But we wound up surrounded

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:11.920
We're about to experience annihilation!

00:22:13.670 --> 00:22:19.790
Brave heroes stand and fight!

00:22:19.960 --> 00:22:21.210
"Firepower boosting potions"

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:22.290
"The more you chew, the more you get super healed"

00:22:22.290 --> 00:22:25.330
Strength strength coursing through us

00:22:25.330 --> 00:22:28.290
Here's some leaves!

00:22:26.670 --> 00:22:28.290
"Let's take them!"

00:22:28.290 --> 00:22:30.630
Time to eat! Da da da dan!

00:22:32.130 --> 00:22:37.130
This food we finally got our hands on is great, huh?

00:22:37.250 --> 00:22:39.880
Whether in caves or in the lost woods,

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:42.880
Oh we eat our fill from nature's buffet

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:47.920
Can't fight on an empty stomach!

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:53.080
Let's go, give it a fusion attack! A super strong magical one

00:22:53.170 --> 00:22:56.170
Split the earth and breathe fire!

00:22:56.170 --> 00:22:57.580
"Ultimate super-powered magic!"

00:22:57.580 --> 00:22:58.960
"A jewelry box of magical power and cheats!"

00:22:58.960 --> 00:23:00.380
"Hellfire of Demise will get them all in one go!"

00:23:00.380 --> 00:23:03.170
"That was all in your dreams, right?"

00:23:02.330 --> 00:23:05.790
A CHEST!

00:23:03.170 --> 00:23:08.290
Yuji! Yuji! The best! The Sage! Yuji! Yuji! Oooh tame me!

00:23:08.290 --> 00:23:10.630
Time to eat! Da da da dan!

00:23:12.460 --> 00:23:14.880
Time for an isekai preview from us reincarnated slimes!

00:23:14.880 --> 00:23:17.670
Hey, looks like some baddies are out for Yuji!

00:23:17.670 --> 00:23:18.880
That can't be good!

00:23:18.880 --> 00:23:22.380
In times like these we just gotta leave
everything to Proud Wolf!

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:23.960
You sure that's a good idea?

00:23:24.080 --> 00:23:26.670
Sure it is! He's fought lotsa baddies!

00:23:26.670 --> 00:23:28.420
And ran away from even more!

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:30.040
Yuji's always helping him, too.

00:23:30.040 --> 00:23:33.880
I'm sure he'll step up now that Yuji's in trouble!

00:23:33.880 --> 00:23:36.460
Who's after him, anyway?

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:38.880
Assassins in pursuit!

00:23:36.880 --> 00:23:42.080
ASSASSINS IN PURSUIT

00:23:38.880 --> 00:23:40.790
Uh-oh, that sounds bad!
